# Lets search tools that read this file, such as ripgrep and Claude Code's Grep,
# into the harness docs copies that `harnesspm sync` writes to
# node_modules/.harnesspm/docs/. The rest of node_modules stays out of search.
# This copy is committed, so harnesspm leaves it as it is and warns when a line
# is missing: keep these lines, in this order.
!/node_modules/
/node_modules/*
!/node_modules/.harnesspm/
/node_modules/.harnesspm/*
!/node_modules/.harnesspm/docs/
